## Global Settings

There are a number of [Global settings](https://help.fooevents.com/docs/topics/events/global-settings/) that effect the behavior and appearance of tickets for all your events.

You can find a list of these settings and their descriptions in the [Ticket Design](https://help.fooevents.com/docs/topics/events/global-settings/#ticket-design) and [PDF Tickets](https://help.fooevents.com/docs/topics/events/global-settings/#pdf-tickets) sections.

## Ticket Themes Settings

You can change the look of your email tickets and PDF Tickets using **FooEvents Ticket Themes**. Find out more in the [Ticket Themes section](https://help.fooevents.com/docs/topics/tickets/ticket-themes/).
